        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An eclipse has blocked out the sun and in the perpetual darkness monsters have risen from the shadows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A small tribe of people have traveled to a ancient dungeon where legend tells of a permanent source of light.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You must make your way through the winding and crumbling ruins, your only weapon a torch. However, when your torch eventually burns out the shadow will take you. Before that happens you must find a way to help those who will come after you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Flame in the Dark is played 1 torch at a time. You must explore the dungeon and unlock ways and passages before your torch runs out, so the next torch bearer can get even deeper; and closer to their salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is dark and you only have a single torch to light your way. Explore, solve puzzles, and use your time wisely because time is always running out...</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An eclipse has blocked out the sun and in the perpetual darkness monsters have risen from the shadows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A small tribe of people have traveled to a ancient dungeon where legend tells of a permanent source of light.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You must make your way through the winding and crumbling ruins, your only weapon a torch. However, when your torch eventually burns out the shadow will take you. Before that happens you must find a way to help those who will come after you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Flame in the Dark is played 1 torch at a time. You must explore the dungeon and unlock ways and passages before your torch runs out, so the next torch bearer can get even deeper; and closer to their salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is dark and you only have a single torch to light your way. Explore, solve puzzles, and use your time wisely because time is always running out...</p>",
        "short_description": "Navigate the darkest of dungeons equipped with only a torch. Explore, solve puzzles, and find a path forward to help the next adventurer before your only light source burns out in this unique roguelite!",
